1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,100
Under the hood, it is all Cloudflare.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,697
Artifacts holds the code: a mainline,

3
00:00:06,697 --> 00:00:12,140
and a fork per agent, with a write
token that expires with the contract.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,920
Read any file at any commit, so time travel is free.

5
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,080
A Durable Object runs each job,
and a desk for every agent.

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:29,980
The merge engine speaks JSON: change
sets in, structured conflicts out.

7
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:35,640
The agents think on Workers AI, with GLM-5.3 Flash.

8
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:41,620
Payouts settle over x402 on Base
Sepolia. A testnet, for now.
